+#### Web push notifications (optional)
+
+Set `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` and `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` to your Web Push VAPID key pair. Both values must be available to the web and background job processes. Keep the private key secret and use the same pair across deployments so existing subscriptions keep working.
